            </note>
            <note corresp="#d5-f4" n="4" xml:id="d5-f4-content">
                <p>Reference is to National Security Study Memorandum (NSSM) 10, East-West Relations, January 28, 1969. (National
                    Archives, RG 59, S/S Files: Lot 80 D 212, National
